  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>코<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>잠<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RxKa6V2HuoQ?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>坐<rt>제-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>最後<rt>줴ˋᄋᅷ-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>班<rt>반ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>夜快車<rt>야쾌ˋ챠ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    je-tioh-juè-au-jît-pān-ya-khoài-chiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>奈<rt>내-</rt></ruby><ruby>心情<rt>심ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>綴<rt>뒈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>車<rt>챠ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>行<rt>걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-nai-sīm-jiéng tuè-chiā-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>車站<rt>챠ˉ잠ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一站<rt>짇잠ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>譀叫<rt>함ˋ교</rt></ruby>’짇샬\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chiā-jām jit-jām hàm-kio’jit-sia̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>敢<rt>갈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>斡頭<rt>왇ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>叫<rt>교ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>名<rt>먀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-kâ̰-oat-tháu kiò-lì’e miá\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>希望<rt>히ˉ빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>會當<rt>에당ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>揣<rt>췌-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>理想<rt>리ˆ셩ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>車站<rt>챠ˉ잠ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hī-bang-e-tàng-chue-tioh-lî-siòng’e chiā-jām\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>好好<rt>호ˆ호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>靠站<rt>코ˋ잠ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一暗<rt>짇암</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hô-hô-khò-jām kuè-jit-am\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>明日<rt>뼹띧ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby>醒<rt>칠ˋ</rt></ruby>’래\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bieng-rît na-chḭ̀’lai\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>飄撇<rt>ᄑᆤˉ폗ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>笑容<rt>쵸ˋ영ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>隨<rt>쉬-</rt></ruby><ruby>風<rt>헝ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>送<rt>상</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    phiāu-phiêt-chiò-yóng sui-hōng-sang\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一聲<rt>짇샬ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>再會<rt>재ˋ훼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>緣<rt>옌ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-siā̰-jài-huē bo-yén’e láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>妝<rt>증ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>徦<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>媠媠<rt>쉬ˆ쉬ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>嫁<rt>게ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>別人<rt>받랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jn̄g-kâh-sûi-sùi bêh-kè-pat-láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>妝<rt>증ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>徦<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>媠媠<rt>쉬ˆ쉬ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>抑<rt>얗</rt></ruby> <ruby>嫁<rt>게ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>別人<rt>받랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span clas